ی", "bn": "আমরা ওহি পাঠিয়েছি", "fa": "وحی کردیم"}}, {"text": "إِلَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أُمِّكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُوحَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "99:5", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6143.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Because thy Lord inspireth her.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O gün yer, Rabbinin ona vahyetmesiyle haberlerini anlatacaktır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اس لیے کہ تمہارے رب نے اسے حکم بھیجا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "karena sesungguhnya Tuhanmu telah memerintahkan (yang sedemikian itu) kepadanya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "بِأَنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبَّكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَوْحَىٰ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8589df6082408a6a4cd9.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "objavio je", "en": "inspired", "tr": "vahyetti", "fr": "a révélé", "id": "mengilhamkan", "ur": "اس نے وحی کی", "bn": "ওহী পাঠালেন", "fa": "وحی کرد"}}, {"text": "لَهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "42:3", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4275.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Thus Allah the Mighty, the Knower inspireth thee (Muhammad) as (He inspired) those before thee.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey Muhammed! Çok güçlü hüküm ve hikmet sahibi olan Allah sana da senden öncekilere de böylece vahyeder.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {